    "details": "<p><strong>Find the Flag. Solve the Challenge. Master Cybersecurity.</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>What The Flag</strong> is a cybersecurity-based <strong>Capture The Flag (CTF)</strong> competition designed to challenge participants through technical puzzles, security challenges, hidden clues and problem-solving tasks.</li>\n<li>Participants will compete across multiple cybersecurity domains, including <strong>Digital Forensics, Reverse Engineering, Cryptography, Open-Source Intelligence (OSINT) and Steganography</strong>.</li>\n<li>Each challenge requires participants to investigate clues, analyze data, uncover hidden information and apply cybersecurity techniques to find the required flag.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Event Structure:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>CTF Kickoff:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Date: 18 September 2026</li>\n<li>Time: 10:00 AM &ndash; 6:00 PM IST</li>\n<li>The competition officially begins as teams tackle a series of cybersecurity challenges.</li>\n<li>Participants solve problems, submit flags and earn points based on their successful completions.</li>\n<li>Challenge points may dynamically decrease as more teams solve them, adding a strategic element to the competition.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Challenge Domains:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Digital Forensics</li>\n<li>Reverse Engineering</li>\n<li>Cryptography</li>\n<li>Open-Source Intelligence (OSINT)</li>\n<li>Steganography</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>What You'll Experience:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Hands-on cybersecurity challenges</li>\n<li>Technical puzzles and hidden clues</li>\n<li>Digital investigation and analysis</li>\n<li>Cryptography and decoding challenges</li>\n<li>OSINT-based investigation</li>\n<li>Reverse engineering problems</li>\n<li>Live competitive leaderboard</li>\n<li>Team-based problem solving</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Event Details:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Format: Capture The Flag (CTF) Competition</li>\n<li>Participation: Teams of 1&ndash;5 members</li>\n<li>Eligibility: Open to all</li>\n<li>Registration Fee: ₹207</li>\n<li>Teams will be ranked based on their total accumulated points, with the team achieving the highest score declared the winner.</li>\n<li>Sharing flags, solutions or using unfair means is strictly prohibited.</li>\n<li>Click here to complete the payment after registering on Unstop: <a title=\"gravitas.vit.ac.in/events/abc220f9-a716-4235-b108-a96c25cfdb9d\" href=\"http://gravitas.vit.ac.in/events/abc220f9-a716-4235-b108-a96c25cfdb9d\">gravitas.vit.ac.in/events/abc220f9-a716-4235-b108-a96c25cfdb9d</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Think. Investigate. Exploit. Capture the Flag.</strong></p>",
